{"version":1,"content":"<p>「一代性感女神」陳雅倫近年北上發展並長居廣州，較少在港露面，近日她於內地登台，與前亞視女星張文慈、袁潔儀等同場，見現已「登六」的陳雅倫逆齡生長，看起來似乎比早幾年更年輕，皮膚狀態極佳，散發少女味，穿起公主裙也完全零違和。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:29:42.524580+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T04:01:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:06.789147+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:23:06.789147+00:00","content_hash":"15908fb2617f9eb3d4b5431f00f8bb14f2aae6f3a7326c07b3841a5196cdbafd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}